{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/833445-3e-pretending-to-be-a-dragonblood","id":833445,"title":"[3E] Pretending to be a Dragonblood","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-19T12:34:22-08:00","id":833445,"title":"[3E] Pretending to be a Dragonblood","content":"So in the previous edition there were ways for a sidereal or other exalt to pretend to be other splats, but especially dragon blooded. In fact the sidereal masqueraded in the order and heptagram. There was a spell and a hearthstone that helped for that. So have stated all that, how could I get it to work in 3E","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10745-nosleeves","name":"nosleeves","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T12:47:37-08:00","id":833448,"title":"","content":"Just keep doing what you did before. In the absence of the DB book, we may assume that using magic to fake elemental powers and being discreet with your other charms will work as well as it ever did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T12:50:08-08:00","id":833451,"title":"","content":"Disguise of a New Face should be easy to port over to Ex3. I didn't see anything in the spell that wouldn't work in the new edition, though I haven't read the Sorcery section very closely.<br /> <br /> What would be a good Control Spell option for Disguise of a New Face?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-19-2016, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T13:28:21-08:00","id":833483,"title":"","content":"A lot of how Sidereals masqueraded was just acting the right way and displaying crazy magic martial arts. It's about more than just displaying an elemental anima banner..which they could also do, with PAoC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T16:43:16-08:00","id":833585,"title":"","content":"Solars, of course, can just use Flawlessly Impenetrable disguise along with Perfect Mirror to mimic a Dragon-Blooded Anima. Stronger than ever. Until we get more detail, I'd let Abyssals and Infernals have rough equivalents.<br /> <br /> The main weakness of this approach is that they don't mimic the destructive effects of Anima Flux. The control effect of Magma Kraken might work for a imitating a Fire Aspect. Failing that, you'd need a sorcerous working or an artifact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10881-anasurimbor","name":"Anasurimbor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"363"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}